Forces a public incident open on status.salaaz.com. Remove this file to close it.

Recording the 2026-09-02 salaaz.com outage, which nothing captured at the time:

  ~00:39 UTC  salaaz.com stopped responding (HTTP 000, connection failing)
   00:41 UTC  functional checks fired — issues #37-#40 opened
   01:20 UTC  recovered; products endpoint returning 20 results again
              total ~40 minutes

Why there was no record: Upptime had been gated at `action_required` since
2026-08-30 (SECRETS_CONTEXT / toJson(secrets)), so it opened no `status` issue
and logged no downtime. The functional checks did fire, but they are
`internal`-labelled and the status page filters those from public view.

NOTE: GitHub will not accept backdated timestamps, so this incident's displayed
duration is how long this issue stays open — not the ~40 minutes above.
